  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C. Cut the sweet\n• potato into smalll chunks. Drizzle with olive oil\n• and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat,\n• then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-ed7af935.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sweet potato is roasting, cut the haloumi\n• into 1cm slices. Thinly slice the tomato into half\n• moons. Roughly chop the cucumber. Thinly slice\n• the red onion (see ingredients). Finely chop the\n• parsley. Finely chop the garlic. In a small bowl,\n• combine the creamy pesto dressing with a dash\n• of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-c4bfa8ec.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a medium saucepan over a medium-high heat\n• with a drizzle of olive oil. Add the pearl couscous\n• and garlic and toast, stirring occasionally,\n• until golden and fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add\n• the water and a pinch of salt. Reduce the heat\n• to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally,\n• until the couscous is tender and the water has\n• been absorbed, 10-12 minutes. Stir through the\n• roasted sweet potato, 1/2 the parsley and 1/2 the\n• kalamata olives.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-1791691f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the couscous is cooking, combine the\n• tomato, cucumber, onion, remaining olives,\n• white wine vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil in a\n• medium bowl. Crumble in the fetta cubes and stir\n• to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-fc9ec8a7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over\n• a medium-high heat. Once hot, cook the haloumi\n• until golden, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-d75004d7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the sweet potato and olive pearl couscous\n• between bowls. Top with the haloumi slices,\n• salad and drizzle over the creamy pesto dressing.\n• Garnish with the remaining parsley.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/607e5996ef55d677a455bbb9/step-c84c1f01.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
